@baseUrl = http://localhost:5197

### OData metadata (EDM entity sets and navigation properties)
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/$metadata
Accept: application/xml

### Customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Customers?$top=100
Accept: application/json

### Product filtering, projection and result count
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Products?$filter=Category%20eq%20%27Electronics%27&$select=Sku,ProductName,UnitPrice&$count=true&$orderby=ProductId&$top=100
Accept: application/json

### Customer country filter, count and paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Customers?$filter=Country%20eq%20%27USA%27&$count=true&$orderby=CustomerId&$skip=0&$top=100
Accept: application/json

### Product projection and category filtering
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Products?$filter=Category%20eq%20%27Electronics%27&$select=ProductName,UnitPrice,Category&$orderby=ProductId&$top=100
Accept: application/json

### Employee filter, sorting and projection
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Employees?$filter=Department%20eq%20%27IT%27&$orderby=Salary%20desc&$select=FirstName,LastName,Department,Salary&$top=100
Accept: application/json

### Employee manager hierarchy
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Employees?$expand=Manager&$top=25
Accept: application/json

### Employee branch relation
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Employees?$expand=BranchOffice&$top=25
Accept: application/json

### Orders with customer and order items
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Orders?$expand=Customer,OrderItems&$top=100
Accept: application/json

### Orders with nested product data
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Orders?$expand=OrderItems($expand=Product),Customer&$top=50
Accept: application/json

### Customer orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Customers?$expand=Orders&$count=true&$top=20
Accept: application/json

### Order items
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/OrderItems?$expand=Product,Order&$top=100
Accept: application/json

### Branch compatibility endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Branches?$top=100
Accept: application/json

### Create or upgrade schema
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/setup/schema

### Seed benchmark data (run schema first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/setup/seed

### Table counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performance/table-counts

### Database size and latest benchmark
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performance/database-summary

### Indexes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performance/index-summary

### Execute ten benchmark scenarios, five runs each
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/performance/benchmarks

### Benchmark history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performance/benchmarks

### Persisted query history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/query-history

### Query history by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/query-history/1

### Record a UI query
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/query-history
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entitySet": "Customers",
  "requestUrl": "/odata/Customers?$top=100",
  "durationMilliseconds": 12.5,
  "payloadBytes": 2048,
  "httpStatusCode": 200,
  "resultCount": 100
}
